License scope
=============

neisep.NerdFonts is an unofficial .NET integration for Nerd Fonts. It contains
material under several licenses.

1. The MIT License below applies ONLY to the original work of neisep: the C#
   API, the code generator (tools/), the tests, and the build and packaging
   files.

2. It does NOT apply to the third-party material this package redistributes:
   - the Symbols Nerd Font (SymbolsNerdFont-Regular.ttf) and every glyph and
     icon in it,
   - the Nerd Fonts glyph-name data the icon constants are generated from,
   - the icon artwork in the package icon (icon.png).
   That material was created by Nerd Fonts and the upstream icon projects. It
   remains under their own licenses (MIT, CC BY 4.0, Apache-2.0, SIL OFL 1.1,
   Unlicense). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and the licenses/ folder, both of
   which are included in the NuGet package and available at
   https://github.com/neisep/neisep.NerdFonts

